 },
 "how_to_read_the_two_counts": "A recorded dipole born with a trade has the first trade of a trade leg in its birth second in so many cases; a second with a trade, taken anywhere in the trade day, holds the first trade of a trade leg in so many. Two counts set side by side; no test of chance is made.",
